# Regenerate with: vhs docs/install-demo.tape
Output docs/install-demo.gif
Output docs/install-demo.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1560
Set Height 360
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/julioflima/bright-control/main/install.sh | bash"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /Pronto/
Sleep 3s
